Laser Kombat: the keys
======================

  Cursor keys     move the tank, or turn it
  Space           fire the laser
  U               undo the last move
  S               keep this moment       R   go back to it
  Return          start the level again
  Right Amiga + cursor up / down (Page Up / Page Down)
                  the level before / the next level
  F1              the keys              F2   what each block does
  Esc             quit

Destroy every enemy tank. Stay out of their line of sight: shoot lasers
at the mirrors, blow up the bombs, or push the enemies into the water.

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
